grilling is the reusable interview primitive: it models a plan as a design
tree, asks the whole settled frontier in numbered rounds with a recommended
answer per question, dispatches sub-agents to find facts rather than asking
the user for them, and stops only when the frontier is empty. Upstream it
also backs grill-with-docs, triage, wayfinder and
improve-codebase-architecture; only grill-me is vendored here alongside it.

Unlike grill-me this skill is model-invocable, so it can trigger on "grill"
phrasing without an explicit slash command.

Changes in this copy: none to SKILL.md or agents/openai.yaml. This NOTICE
